  chooseText: "Selected the mission data core. If its memory survived the crash,
    we may recover your flight plan, your orders\u2026 and why this ship was here
    at all."
  completedText: Data core recovered. I restored partial mission logs, but several
    entries were deliberately locked before impact. This was not a routine flight.
    You were sent here.
  nextDayText: Circulation, focus, and stamina all benefit from a steady walk. Begin
    when ready.
  showPortrait: 1
  descriptionText: "A sealed memory unit from the ship\u2019s central systems. It
    contains damaged fragments of navigation data, mission records, and crew logs.
    Recovering it may reveal what brought you to this planet."
